data: {"id": "61baf5754abd4fa5-thinking-parallel_evidence-880", "run_id": "61baf5754abd4fa5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "read_context_archive", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "query_pod_tracing succeeded but truncated due to SQL/limit constraints. Retrieved 23 flows/traces for pod workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc on node2 (172.16.104.16). All 8 sample L7 flows show HTTP GET /work ", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789091980811, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_4e9d3c806f864c4098303344", "tool_sequence": 10, "semantic_success": true, "result": "query_pod_tracing succeeded but truncated due to SQL/limit constraints. Retrieved 23 flows/traces for pod workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc on node2 (172.16.104.16). All 8 sample L7 flows show HTTP GET /work from 172.16.104.62 to 172.16.104.16 returning HTTP 503 with high latency (~19-29s).\nkey_facts: [\"Entity: pod workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc (UID: 705925d8-1e60-4c25-8300-62e280589dee), container app, node node2, IP 172.16.104.16\", \"Window: 2026-09-11T01:29:20Z to 01:59:20Z\", \"Counts: matched=20, retrieved/returned=23, dropped=0\", \"Truncation: true (backend_query stage, reason: sql_limit_reached_possible_more_rows)\", \"Flow Pattern: src_ip 172.16.104.62 -> dst_ip 172.16.104.16\", \"Request: HTTP GET /work\", \"Response: HTTP 503 consistently across all samples\", \"Latency: 18659us to 29001us (18s - 29s)\", \"Timestamps: 2026-09-11 09:30:28, 09:31:55, 09:34:01, 09:38:59, 09:40:25 (Asia/Shanghai)\"]\nmissing: [\"Tracing data (spans) truncated or limited to 3 items\", \"Remaining flows after sample 8\", \"Root cause of HTTP 503\"]", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/61baf5754abd4fa5-g1/tools/013-evidence-read_context_archive.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/61baf5754abd4fa5-g1/tools/013-evidence-read_context_archive.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/61baf5754abd4fa5-g1/tools/013-evidence-read_context_archive.summary.txt"}

