data: {"id": "61baf5754abd4fa5-thinking-parallel_evidence-882", "run_id": "61baf5754abd4fa5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "read_context_archive", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "Tool `read_context_archive` successfully loaded the complete topology evidence for Pod `workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` in namespace `aiops-case-09`. The output confirms 5 relationships (scheduled on Node,", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789091990844, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_b047d15627b34c698be4578a", "tool_sequence": 12, "semantic_success": true, "result": "Tool `read_context_archive` successfully loaded the complete topology evidence for Pod `workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` in namespace `aiops-case-09`. The output confirms 5 relationships (scheduled on Node, owns Container, owned by ReplicaSet, Service selects Pod), covering the entire 21039-char archive with no truncation.\nkey_facts: [\"Resource: Pod `workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` (UID: 705925d8-1e60-4c25-8300-62e280589dee) in namespace `aiops-case-09`\", \"Node: Scheduled on `node2` (IP: 172.16.104.16)\", \"Containers: Contains container `app`\", \"Topology: Owned by ReplicaSet `workload-5f4fb9ff45` (UID: b30f992b-a1b5-4f51-887c-8986140afc99); Owned by Deployment `workload` (UID: 804049be-613f-44aa-a5d6-2069dc0b0413)\", \"Service: Service `workload` (UID: bf71164b-744a-4434-bedf-6ba612d4ad3a, ClusterIP: 172.30.17.7) selects this Pod via label `app.kubernetes.io/name: workload` (Port 8080 -> http)\", \"Archive Status: Total 21039 chars, returned 21039 chars (100%), no truncation\", \"Data Integrity: 5 relationships retrieved, all confidence 'high'\"]", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/61baf5754abd4fa5-g1/tools/015-evidence-read_context_archive.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/61baf5754abd4fa5-g1/tools/015-evidence-read_context_archive.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/61baf5754abd4fa5-g1/tools/015-evidence-read_context_archive.summary.txt"}

